## Quality bar (operator is not QA)

- Browser-verify user-visible changes; agent runs existing tests when relevant — see `rigorous-qa-before-handoff.mdc`, `verify-ui-before-done.mdc`.
- **Intent contract:** when [action] → [observable outcome on real data]; verify before handoff.
- Do not leave `E2E-*` test debris (`agent-test-cleanup.mdc`).
- Brief **Verified** line in reply; expand only on failure or blocker.

---

## Backups and “oops” recovery

- Scheduled daily backup + weekly purge — see `database-backup-operations.mdc`.
- **Undo for schema/data ops = restore backup**, not operator intervention.
- Off-site copy of ZIPs is operator-owned periodic ops; agents remind if discussing disaster recovery.

---

## Git and deploy

- Still **no commit/push** unless operator asks (`user rules`).
- Still **no push to `dev`/`main`** without “approve push” (`project.mdc`).
- Shopify theme: AI Dev theme `196218716241` for verification; no live theme publish without approval (`shopify-page-draft-safety.mdc`).

