## Handoff self-check

Before sending the final reply, read **`verification-handoff-gate.mdc`** and confirm:

- [ ] Task purpose met from operator’s perspective (not only code compiled)
- [ ] **Intent Contract** written in user words; every line verified on real URL
- [ ] **Right surface** — QA hit the exact facet/menu/column the user cares about, not grep/page-load
- [ ] **Environment** — preview vs live stated if theme work; operator’s URL or explicit preview-only
- [ ] Preferences above respected (autonomy where safe, backup noted if DB touched)
- [ ] Verification run on real path; gaps stated explicitly
- [ ] UI work includes `### Layout verification` when applicable (screenshots show contract outcome)

